{"suttaId":"tha-ap499","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2683,2700],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap499:0.3":"Udakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap499:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, bhikkhusaṅghe anuttare;","tha-ap499:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, pānīghaṭamapūrayiṃ.","tha-ap499:2.1":"“Pabbatagge dumagge vā, ākāse vātha bhūmiyaṃ;","tha-ap499:2.3":"Yadā pānīyamicchāmi, khippaṃ nibbattate mama.","tha-ap499:3.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap499:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dakadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap499:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap499:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap499:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap499:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā udakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap499:8.1":"Udakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
